## Q4. Vocabulary counts: coverage C(N), dense memory M(N), Zipf fit

Vocabulary words: 3,694,560; sum of counts: 3,491,195,990; max count 330,797,339 ('DDDDD'); words with count > 50 (not n-gram words): 1,240,558; min count 5.
Ranking: count descending, ties broken by word bytes ascending.

